    "detailed_description": "The game follows John Hill, a 42-year-old retired detective suffering from post-traumatic stress syndrome following the suicide of his wife. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAfter a series of hallucinations John is trapped in \u201cA Simple Door\u201d which this time manifests itself as a 1970's television studio, forcing John to go through a series of atrocious and repulsive scenarios created by his own mind, thus making John face his own personal hell now called \u201cA Simple Door\u201d. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTry to escape from \u201cA Simple Door\u201d by facing your past, your darkest secrets and your fears through the doors.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your walkman and your intellect to solve the puzzles and escape from \u201cA Simple Door\u201d<br />\r\n<br />\r\nfirst person psychological horror game, solve puzzles and immerse yourself in this universe.",
